{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-7","kind":"proposition","title":"相等的量与同一量形成相同的比","englishTitle":"Equal magnitudes have to the same the same ratio, as also has the same to equal magnitudes.","book":5,"number":7,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.7","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.7/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":7,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","contentId":"euclid-5-7","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"705e29098bc594095140633320cb34dc15830b39df5f62b08b2699ac4d38c224","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-7.statement","euclid-5-7.construction.1","euclid-5-7.construction.2","euclid-5-7.proof.1","euclid-5-7.proof.2","euclid-5-7.proof.3","euclid-5-7.proof.4","euclid-5-7.proof.5","euclid-5-7.proof.6","euclid-5-7.proof.7","euclid-5-7.proof.8","euclid-5-7.proof.9","euclid-5-7.conclusion","euclid-5-7.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-7.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9f7369b627dca432e0c3f9e5e83c06d818aef124f860ddec285e17a27f6628f1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Equal magnitudes have to the same the same ratio, as also has the same to equal magnitudes."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"相等的量与同一个量之比相等；同一个量与这些相等的量之比也相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"410cd1c14c6307bbf7e29d80d3b2a9e0591cbd26c12d257b91109a1ecf8d91a9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be equal magnitudes and C any other, chance, magnitude; I say that each of the magnitudes A, B has the same ratio to C, and C has the same ratio to each of the magnitudes A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B等量,再加C等量,机会,机会,数量;我说,A,B等量的每一个比例与C等量的每一个比例相同,C等量的每一个比例与A,B等量的每一个比例相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dc56948c893d4ce8fd1a6f4c2c33e750c3024f3c43a0e8d25f234cce6f01d62f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let equimultiples D, E of A, B be taken, and of C another, chance, multiple F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A中同倍数 D E B C会 F"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a33d84b5935cea2f1e164d7fc2f7e0d33b397f587c9be2ca9390dd4c1e38af9a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since D is the same multiple of A that E is of B, while A is equal to B, therefore D is equal to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"礛D是A的乘数,E是B、A等于B因此,D等于E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98f0eec6f9433098f83a8412090f66bb48f15df6d6c08edde413a9e9043daee8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But F is another, chance, magnitude."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但F是另一个机会, 规模。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7afd82fc8f49d926c91fbba03f454331cb3a58d1fa3644be913e6e68ced576b4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If therefore D is in excess of F, E is also in excess of F, if equal to it, equal; and, if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果D多出F,E,如果等于F,则等于;如果少于,则等于。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1d71006e9c3958fee82a465c7c5a7d27bbbe615b680a27e5385a50e6079e70c2","citations":["euclid-5-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And D, E are equimultiples of A, B, while F is another, chance, multiple of C; therefore, as A is to C, so is B to C. [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D,E是A,B的同倍数,而F是另一个机会,乘以C;因此,A对C的比等于B对C的比；A 与 C 之比等于 B 与 C 之比。 [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4259208ea378f21f3b24ebf380a2274f6b0dc0bfb84510c182c591df425bbc26","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that C also has the same ratio to each of the magnitudes A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,C星等与A,B星等的比相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"49e0fbb4d8e46f7fba13e11c713d4a81bda7f09fdab442386b660249b21c7028","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, we can prove similarly that D is equal to E; and F is some other magnitude."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,通过同样的构思,我们可以同样证明,D等于E;F等于其他等级。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a759c4f16178f05131fc8ed57fd4b1e7eb9e2e0454e94ce483d652f1c727e92d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If therefore F is in excess of D, it is also in excess of E, if equal, equal; and, if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果因此,F项超过D项,则在平等、平等的情况下,也超过E项;如果较少,则少于E项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6501b9b137cf5e1dd19a872ffec159226e0114213cbc43b8b451574b5c72804","citations":["euclid-5-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And F is a multiple of C, while D, E are other, chance, equimultiples of A, B; therefore, as C is to A, so is C to B. [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"F是C的倍数,D,E是另一个机会,A,B是同倍数;因此,C对A的比等于C对B的比；C 与 A 之比等于 C 与 B 之比。 [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2da5084663995e4ec91ab987181b9e8609efe09f01fb4acfc7801605f51e42d7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that, if any magnitudes are proportional, they will also be proportional inversely. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"推论,从这一点来看,很明显,如果任何星系是成比例,那么它们也会是成比例, 反之。Q, E,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-7.source","contentId":"euclid-5-7","revisionId":"euclid-5-7@raw-705e29098bc59409","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4aed13e487c11ca2a93dbce599ce55e8007941a1af912311027a41c38f06ab0c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.7/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.7\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff3